  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "İlk `max_steps` eylemi gez: `enumerate(actions[:max_steps], 1)`.",
      "en": "Go through the first `max_steps` actions: `enumerate(actions[:max_steps], 1)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Cevap yoksa dönülen tur: `min(len(actions), max_steps)`.",
      "en": "Without an answer the rounds run: `min(len(actions), max_steps)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef loop_steps(actions, max_steps):\n    for step, action in enumerate(actions[:max_steps], 1):\n        if action == \"answer\":\n            return [step, True]\n    return [min(len(actions), max_steps), False]\n\n\nprint(loop_steps([\"tool\", \"tool\", \"answer\"], 5))\nprint(loop_steps([\"tool\"] * 9, 5))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef loop_steps(actions, max_steps):\n    for step, action in enumerate(actions[:max_steps], 1):\n        if action == \"answer\":\n            return [step, True]\n    return [min(len(actions), max_steps), False]\n\n\nprint(loop_steps([\"tool\", \"tool\", \"answer\"], 5))\nprint(loop_steps([\"tool\"] * 9, 5))\n```"
    }
  ],
